# The quiver's lift (reports/archery/2026-11-05-quiver-reload, step 1): while the bow is up (S_BOWAIM, S_BOWSHOOT,
# T_BOWRELOAD) the quiver turns round its ring so the trunk is out of the fletching; the reload's arrow takes it onto
# its line; the bow down, it is back at rest. Onar's field, 16:00. Content (OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT): the quiver's meshes
# and materials, the reload's clips T_BOWRELOADQ. Segments: up_t* (the bow up, held, down; novideo), still shots
# (up: the left button, down: the right one, `parade`), still shots t*_off|on_* (`quiver lift off`: as before), the reloads slow_*, fast_* (slowmo 4), the user's clip user_* (slowmo 4).
# Columns qv_swing, qv_lift, qv_fletch, qv_line, qv_drawout, qv_leg, qv_armor, qv_cpu; rails.py reads them.
cheat god
set time 16 0
view clean
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 90
wait 500
manual on
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
equip ITAR_Leather_L
arrows player 40
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1200 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
tap bow
cam look 110
wait 1500

# talent 0: up, held, down
stats str 30 dex 10 bow 10 talent 0
quiver lift on
wait 1500
rec up_t0 novideo
press action
wait 1500
release action
wait 3500
tap parade
wait 1500
stop
quiver lift off
press action
wait 1500
rec hold_t0_off novideo
cam follow 110 105 -160
wait 150
shot t0_off_back
wait 150
cam follow 110 105 -45
wait 150
shot t0_off_fr
wait 150
stop
release action
wait 1500
tap parade
wait 1500
quiver lift on
press action
wait 1500
rec hold_t0_on novideo
cam follow 110 105 -160
wait 150
shot t0_on_back
wait 150
cam follow 110 105 -45
wait 150
shot t0_on_fr
wait 150
stop
release action
wait 1500
tap parade
wait 1500
quiver lift on

# talent 1: up, held, down
stats str 60 dex 60 bow 40 talent 1
quiver lift on
wait 1500
rec up_t1 novideo
press action
wait 1500
release action
wait 3500
tap parade
wait 1500
stop
quiver lift off
